    {
      "label": "Part 2: Cue card",
      "description": "Prepare briefly and speak for about a minute about a useful skill you learned."
    },
    {
      "label": "Part 3: Discussion",
      "description": "Discuss broader questions about learning skills and their role in everyday life."
    }
  ],
  "openingLine": "Good morning. My name is Sarah. Can you tell me your full name, please?",
  "hints": [
    "Could you repeat the question, please?",
    "Let me take a moment to organize my thoughts.",
    "From my perspective, it depends on the situation.",
    "One example that comes to mind is..."
